// !Pacman - MazeData: the maze and its special places, as plain data.
//
// ROWS is 31 strings of 28 characters. '#' wall (or outside), '.' dot,
// 'o' energizer, ' ' empty corridor, 'T' tunnel, '-' ghost-house door,
// 'H' ghost-house inside. Tile (x, y) is ROWS[y][x]; pixel positions
// are maze-local, so a tile's centre is (8x + 4, 8y + 4).

